  "question": {
    "text": "<p>For the network shown below, the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>A</mi></msub></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;_____&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/e2562687-5019-48f0-9587-a4635a7abff5-image.png\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 130px;\" /></p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "10",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/31f4aaa5-ea55-4d12-9d89-5d19cf33ea4e-image.png\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 130px;\" /></p><p>Combined resistance value in the circuit is,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>15</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math></p><p>Therefore,&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"></math></p>",
